Building.CanProduce: small wonders are buildable, once per civilization and by one city at a time (a Forbidden Palace not in the palace city; Heroic Epic and The Pentagon, which Civ III gates on armies the engine lacks, stay unbuildable; the Palace still cannot be moved). ChooseProducible scores a Forbidden Palace by the corruption it would remove.

